firmware-redmi-marble (20261008-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rename the package (source and binary) from firmware-xiaomi-marble to
    firmware-redmi-marble: the retail name of this device is Redmi Note 12
    Turbo and the other two packages already use the redmi namespace
    (linux-redmi-marble). Upstream blob source stays
    iLtanaka/firmware-xiaomi-marble - only the Debian name changes.
    Provides/Replaces/Breaks on the old name make the swap seamless; the
    device-installed firmware-xiaomi-marble is replaced on upgrade.

