firmware-xiaomi-marble (20261008-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging of the marble firmware blobs.
  * Source: iLtanaka/firmware-xiaomi-marble v20261008. Install paths follow
    the postmarketOS firmware-xiaomi-marble aport, adapted to UsrMerge.
  * debian/rules creates the wcn-prefixed Bluetooth symlinks (qca/hp* ->
    qca/wcnhpbtfw21.tlv style). btqca requests those names on WCN6855, so
    without the links the Bluetooth firmware load fails with -ENOENT even
    though qca/hpbtfw21.tlv is present.

